  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1480831/description_7301b781-b5a5-4657-84a1-d1a66184dea1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"812\" height=\"457\"></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b0387f65-7be1-4dd4-80e9-51dc17c12f41.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"12\" height=\"26\"> <span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">這個資源包將終界箱轉化成了一個魔法箱子。</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><strong>紋理有發光的部分，當你打開它時，你可以看到星星，好像你的物品存儲在一個維度。</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5cea18b1-8d44-42e5-baf2-4049291c314a.png\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2f35b879-9c99-4d94-8ad7-241fed54cf77.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"19\" height=\"29\"><span style=\"color:#fc0000\">他在做什麼！</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#fc0000\"><span style=\"color:#fc0000\">更改了終界箱的紋理</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#fc0000\"><span style=\"color:#fc0000\">更改了終界箱的模型</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#fc0000\"><span style=\"color:#fc0000\">它對紋理有發光的部分</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_58bb23cf-2c2c-4349-a6ab-110533037e6a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"28\" height=\"27\">&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">重要提示</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>為了使資源包正常工作，你需要使用Optifine。</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_be1988cb-5dd7-4e19-83fb-2c28e10dacfa.png\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_32fd4ba4-3c38-4f6a-8f7e-401cee07c813.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"578\" height=\"76\"></strong></p>",
